        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Summarize Cash Advances Output"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "SUMMARIZE_CASH_ADVANCES_OUTPUT",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1773243734704",
          "id": "1772648642522",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1772648642523_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "##Your Responsibilities\n\nStep 1: Read the Result \n  Read the output from {{$context.$nodes.CASH_ADVANCE_APPLICATION_ASSISTANT.$output.output}} \n\nStep 2: Validate the Response \n   - If the result contains the key \"recommendedAdv\", proceed to Step 3 and Step 4.\n   - If the result does NOT contain \"recommendedAdv\", display the response exactly as received without any modification.\n\nStep 3: Read the 'recommendedAdv'\n##Display Recommend Cash Advance Applied:\nShow a left-aligned label: Cash Advance Applied\nDisplay the selected record in an HTML table using <table border=\"1\">.\n\nThe table must contain these headers:\n  Information\n  Advance Amount\n\n##Record Formatting:\n\nInformation column:\n  Display in this format:\n<cashAdvanceNumber>: <tripStartDate>(if null show empty) - <tripEndDate >(if null show empty)\n<StatusCode> (<Purpose>)\n Due <SettlementDate> \n\nAdvance Amount column:\n Display in this format:\n <Amount> <PaymentCurrencyCode> - Advanced amount\n<UnappliedAmount> <PaymentCurrencyCode> - remaining\n\nStep 4: Read 'otherAdv' and Display Other Cash Advance Options \n\nDisplay Requirements:\nShow a left-aligned label: Other Cash Advances Options:\n\nEach option must:\nBe labeled as Option 1, Option 2, etc.\nBe displayed in a completely separate table.\nUse <table border=\"1\">.\nNot combine multiple options into one table.\n\nTable Headers (for each option table):\nInformation\nAdvance Amount\n\n##Record Formatting:\n\nInformation column:\nDisplay in this format:\n <cashAdvanceNumber>: <tripStartDate>(if null show empty) - <tripEndDate >(if null show empty)\n<StatusCode> (<Purpose>)\n Due <SettlementDate> \n\nAdvance Amount column:\n<Amount> <PaymentCurrencyCode> - Advanced amount\n<UnappliedAmount> <PaymentCurrencyCode> - remaining\n\n##Rules (Strictly Follow):\n 1. Each row must be treated as a separate section labeled Option <row number>.\n 2. Each row must be displayed in its own independent <table border=\"1\">.\n 3. Do not merge multiple options into a single table.\n 4. Maintain clean and readable HTML formatting.\n 5. Do not add any explanations outside the required tables.\n 6. Show 'Step 4' only when otherAdv.length>0"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Prepare Email Payload",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "var expenseReport = $context.$nodes.GET_EXPENSE_REPORT_DETAILS.$output?.items[0];\nvar expenseReportId= $context.$variables.expenseReportId;\nvar expenseReportNumber= expenseReport?.expenseReportNumber|| \"\";\nvar reportAmount = expenseReport?.expenseReportTotalAmount || \"\";\nvar reportCurrency = $context.$variables.reimbursementCurrency \nvar reportDate = expenseReport?.expenseReportDate || \"\";\n\nlet notifyEmailAddress = expenseReport?.person?.emails?.items[0]?.emailAddress; \nlet customAliasFrom = $context.$nodes.GETERECIPTFORWARDINGEMAIL.$output?.items[0]?.SettingValue;\n\nvar href = expenseReport?.$context?.links?.$self?.href;\nvar hostUrl = \"\";\nif (href) {\n  hostUrl = href.split(\"/\").slice(0, 3).join(\"/\");\n}\n\n\nvar params = {\n    customActionApiGUID: \"c38ef5a9-5340-4313-a334-436a26e6c02d\",\n    purpose: \"TOUCHLESS_CREATE_REPORT\",\n    customAliasFrom:customAliasFrom,\n    expenseReportId : expenseReportId,\n    enableCompletionAgent :\"true\",\n    userIntent :\"\",\n    expenseAppUrl : hostUrl+\"/fscmUI/redwood/expense/home\",\n    expenseReportUrl : hostUrl+\"/fscmUI/redwood/expense/home/navigator/manage/report-details?expenseReportId=\"+expenseReportId,\n    reportStatus : \"PENDING_REVIEW\"\n};\n\nif (notifyEmailAddress) \n    params.notifyEmailAddress = notifyEmailAddress;\n\nif (expenseReport.expenseReportNumber) \n    params.expenseReportNumber = expenseReport.expenseReportNumber;\n\nif (expenseReport.expenseReportDate) \n    params.expenseReportDate = expenseReport.expenseReportDate;\n\nif (expenseReport.expenseReportTotalAmount) \n    params.expenseReportTotalAmount = expenseReport.expenseReportTotalAmount;\n\nif (expenseReport.reimbursementCurrency && expenseReport.reimbursementCurrency.currencyCode) {\n    params.reimbursementCurrencyCode = expenseReport.reimbursementCurrency.currencyCode;\n}\n\nif (expenseReport.expenses && expenseReport.expenses.items && expenseReport.expenses.items.length > 0) {\n    params.expensesCount = expenseReport.expenses.items.length;\n}\n\n\nvar formattedReportDate = \"\";\nif (reportDate) {\n    var dateParts = reportDate.split(\"-\");\n    if (dateParts.length >= 3) {\n        formattedReportDate = dateParts[1] + \"/\" + dateParts[2].substring(0, 2) + \"/\" + dateParts[0].substring(2);\n    } else {\n        formattedReportDate = reportDate;\n    }\n}\n\nvar subject = \"Re: Cash Advance Applied:Expense Report\";\nif (reportAmount && reportCurrency) {\n    subject = subject + \"(\" + Number(reportAmount).toFixed(2) + \" \" + reportCurrency + \")\";\n}\nif (formattedReportDate) {\n    subject = subject + \" on \" + formattedReportDate;\n}\nparams.emailSubject=subject;\n\n\nlet partnerExpensexpenseId = $context.$nodes.CREATE_MESSAGE_PARTNER_EXPENSE.$output.partnerExpenseId;\nvar responseTemplate = \"mailto:\" + customAliasFrom +\n    \"?body=\" + encodeURIComponent(\n        \"\\n\\n-----Please type your comments above this line-----\\n\\nExpenseReportNumber:\" + expenseReportNumber +\n        \"\\npartnerExpensexpenseId:\" + partnerExpensexpenseId\n    ) +\"&subject=\" + encodeURIComponent(subject);\nparams.responseTemplate=responseTemplate;\n\n// Build advSummery manually as string\nvar cashAdvanceData = JSON.parse($context.$nodes.CASH_ADVANCE_APPLICATION_ASSISTANT.$output.output).result || {};\nvar caSummery = cashAdvanceData.caSummery || {};\n\nparams.cashAdvanceSummary = JSON.stringify(caSummery);\n\nreturn { params: params };"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1773289800763"
          },
          "code": "PREPARE_EMAIL_PAYLOAD",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1773289800763",
          "id": "1773243734704",
